      en: ["Home to most of Acadia National Park.", "Known for its rocky coastline.", "Highest point is Cadillac Mountain.", "Popular summer destination."],
      es: ["Alberga la mayor parte del Parque Nacional Acadia.", "Conocida por su costa rocosa.", "El punto más alto es la montaña Cadillac.", "Popular destino de verano."],
